-- Seed: real IEB past papers (previous "IEB" past_paper rows were OpenStax
-- practice-book placeholders, not actual exam papers).
--
-- What this adds (267 rows, EVERY URL machine-verified to serve %PDF bytes):
--   IEB National Senior Certificate question papers 2017-2023, November
--   session, across 24 mainstream Grade 12 subjects — Mathematics, Physical
--   Sciences, Life Sciences, Accounting, English HL/FAL, Geography, History,
--   Information Technology, CAT, Business Studies, Economics, Mathematical
--   Literacy, Advanced Programme Mathematics, Technical Maths/Sciences,
--   EGD, Music, Visual Arts, Dramatic Arts, Consumer Studies, Tourism,
--   Afrikaans FAL, IsiZulu FAL and Life Orientation. Question papers are
--   paired with marking guidelines (memos) wherever the archive has them.
--
-- Source: the open pastpaperbank community archive
-- (github.com/jacquesamsel/pastpaperbank — backing store of
-- pastpaperbank.com), linked via raw.githubusercontent.com. All 512 URLs
-- (267 papers + 245 memos) verified to return %PDF magic bytes; random
-- papers content-checked via first-page text extraction (e.g. "NATIONAL
-- SENIOR CERTIFICATE EXAMINATION NOVEMBER 2023 ACCOUNTING: PAPER I").
--
-- Generated by scripts/build_ieb_paper_seed.py.
-- Idempotent: NOT EXISTS guard on (title, curriculum).

